inherited from UBI base); configurable CA paths for Milvus (`ca_pem_path`, `client_pem_path`) and auth (`tls_cafile`) | distribution/config.yaml:89-91,268 |\n149\t| **Non-FIPS crypto risks** | No explicit FIPS opt-in detected; FIPS mode depends on base image OpenSSL configuration; `--insecure` flag passed to `ogx run` in entrypoint (controls application-level behavior, not TLS) | distribution/entrypoint.sh:79 |\n150\t\n151\t_The Python `cryptography` library binds to system OpenSSL via cffi. On a FIPS-enabled UBI base image, OpenSSL operates in FIPS mode and Python crypto operations use FIPS-validated algorithms. No explicit FIPS opt-in or non-FIPS algorithm usage was detected in the distribution configuration. The `--insecure` flag on `ogx run` is an OGX framework parameter controlling internal validation behavior, not a TLS or FIPS bypass._\n152\t## Data Flows\n153\t\n154\t### Flow 1: Inference Request\n155\t\n156\t| Step | Source | Destination | Port | Protocol | Encryption | Auth |\n157\t|------|--------|-------------|------|----------|------------|------|\n158\t| 1 | Client | OGX Server | 8321/TCP | HTTP | Platform-delegated | OAuth2 bearer token (when configured) |\n159\t| 2 | OGX Server | Inference Provider (vLLM / cloud) | Configurable | HTTP/HTTPS | TLS (configurable per provider) | API token / IAM / bearer token |\n160\t| 3 | OGX Server | PostgreSQL | 5432/TCP | PostgreSQL | Platform-delegated | Username/password |\n161\t\n162\t### Flow 2: RAG Query\n163\t\n164\t| Step | Source | Destination | Port | Protocol | Encryption | Auth |\n165\t|------|--------|-------------|------|----------|------------|------|\n166\t| 1 | Client | OGX Server | 8321/TCP | HTTP | Platform-delegated | OAuth2 bearer token (when configured) |\n167\t| 2 | OGX Server | Vector DB (Milvus / PGVector / Qdrant) | Configurable | HTTP/gRPC/SQL | Configurable (mTLS for Milvus) | Token / API key / password |\n168\t| 3 | OGX Server | Inference Provider | Configurable | HTTP/HTTPS | TLS | API t